@HostAddress = http://localhost:5187

### Summarize a proposal
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/proposals/summarize
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "proposal": "We want to split our monolithic order system into microservices so teams can deploy independently. The new Order, Payment and Inventory services will communicate through RabbitMQ and each own a PostgreSQL database. We must keep the existing REST API contract unchanged and finish before Black Friday. It is unclear how distributed transactions between Payment and Inventory will be handled."
}

### Summarize with an empty proposal (expects a validation error)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/proposals/summarize
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "proposal": ""
}

### Review a proposal
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/proposals/review
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "proposal": "We want to split our monolithic order system into microservices so teams can deploy independently. The new Order, Payment and Inventory services will communicate through RabbitMQ and each own a PostgreSQL database. We must keep the existing REST API contract unchanged and finish before Black Friday. It is unclear how distributed transactions between Payment and Inventory will be handled."
}

### Review a proposal against standards (RAG)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/proposals/review-with-standards
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "proposal": "We are building an insurance back office as a modular monolith. It calls external insurers over HTTP. Claim submissions must remain accepted during temporary insurer outages. No durable intake or recovery mechanism has been chosen.",
  "question": "How should accepted claims survive an insurer outage?"
}

### Missing-policy case (expects insufficient_evidence)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/proposals/review-with-standards
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "proposal": "We are building an insurance back office as a modular monolith hosted in a single region.",
  "question": "What exact Australian data-residency policy has our organization approved?"
}

